Nostyra Online - third-party Rust crates
========================================

The web edition's WebAssembly module (nostyra_web_bg.wasm, built from
crates/web-bindings) contains the open-source Rust crates listed below, built from
their unmodified crates.io releases (source: https://crates.io/crates/<name>/<version>).
Each licence text follows the list of crates that use it.

